   - Utilizes the effective-one-body formalism to model systems with total mass larger than 4M⊙, combining post-Newtonian results with black hole perturbation theory and numerical relativity.
   - Employs approximately 250,000 template waveforms to cover the parameter space of the systems being studied [gravitational-waves_chunk_0035]. 

3. **Background Estimation**:
